Description: Cast a desktop to Miracast and other wireless displays
 A DTK6 app from 01tool that discovers Wi-Fi Display sinks over
 NetworkManager P2P and DLNA MediaRenderers on the LAN. Miracast
 uses WFD/RTSP and RTP. DLNA serves a live MPEG-TS over HTTP and
 calls AVTransport Play. The UI names the protocol on every row.
 .
 Wayland capture is stubbed until a ScreenCast portal exists.
 .
 This is not an official Deepin / DDE component.
